# Play test of The Iron Graveyard (CIPlay iron_graveyard, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the yard
# (2 m) on the south beach, its gate at the west end, the hulls' decks (the tanker 5.2-6 m, the trawler 4.2-5 m, the ferry
# 4.9-5.5 m) up Raft's ladders on their sides, the barge in its hole (8 m down), the crane's platform (6.4 m), the office
# (floor 2.05 m), the ramp up the mesa's south-east flank, the turbine on its rim (13.8 m).
island The Iron Graveyard
expect step 0
expect title Breakers' Yard
wait 5

# In through the gate: the dogs and their alpha come for the player; the foreman's board by the office
walk -46 -64 to -38 -64.5 to -32 -64.5 h=2
zone yardgate
expect step 1
kill Hyena
walk -32 -64.5 to -10 -62 to 8.4 -60.6 h=2
read Foreman's board
expect step 3

# The blades in the beached hulls: up each one's ladder onto its deck, to its locker
walk 8.4 -60.6 to 3 -61.5 to -6 -61.5 to -8.6 -70 to -9.8 -78 h=1.6
climb -11.1 -78 h=1.55
climb -11.1 -78 h=3.97
expect stand -14 -78 h=6 below=8
walk -14 -78 to -14 -82.4 h=6
open Tanker's locker
at 3.6 -79 h=2.4
climb 5.35 -79 h=1.2
climb 5.35 -79 h=3.6
expect stand 7.2 -79 h=4.8 below=7
walk 7.2 -79 to 8.3 -82.8 h=4.3
open Trawler's locker
at 21.4 -75 h=2.2
climb 22.75 -75 h=1.05
climb 22.75 -75 h=3.45
expect stand 24.6 -75 h=5.2 below=7.5
walk 24.6 -75 to 24.4 -79.8 h=4.9
open Ferry's locker
expect story blade 3
expect step 4

# The barge sunk off the beach: its angler, the crate from its hold
at -1.5 -94.3 h=-6.5
zone barge
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
open Barge's hold
expect story blade 4
expect step 6

# Up the crane's ladders to its platform: the operator's note
walk 8 -60.5 to 3 -61.5 to 0.35 -62.7 h=2
climb 0.35 -63.56 h=2
climb 0.35 -63.56 h=4.43
expect stand -1.2 -64.6 h=6.4 below=8.5
read Crane operator's note
expect step 7

# The yard office's safe: the crane's key; the crane lifts the hub off the tanker
walk 6 -64 to 10.5 -64 to 13 -64 to 13.6 -61.4 h=2.05 below=4.5
open Yard office safe
expect story cranekey 1
expect step 8
walk 13 -64 to 6 -64 to 2.5 -62 h=2
use crane
expect message coughs into life
expect story hub 1
expect step 9

# Up the ramp cut in the mesa's cliff to the turbine's mast: the hub and the blades; the store opens
walk 2.5 -62 to 10 -57 to 19.5 -57.5 to 19.5 -64.2 to 30 -64.2 to 40 -62 to 42 -60.5 h=3.4
walk 42 -60 to 31 -52 to 20 -44 h=13.6
walk 20 -44 to 8 -43 to -3.5 -43 h=13.8
zone turbinehill
expect step 10
use turbine
expect message the turbine turns
expect story blade 0
expect story hub 0
at 25 -61.4 h=3.1
open Yard store
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect done
# Raft's story machinery: the radio is dead without power and the generator won't start without its part; the part from
# the mechanic's toolbox starts it, the radio then gives away the supply drop on the mesa. The trawler's engine is dry;
# the gas tank from the fuel crate starts it and its locker shakes open
use officeradio
expect message radio is dead
use yardgenerator
expect message A part is missing
open Mechanic's toolbox
expect story raft-Tangaroa_GeneratorPart 1
use yardgenerator
expect message The power is on
expect story raft-Tangaroa_GeneratorPart 0
expect hidden supplydrop
use officeradio
expect shown supplydrop
open Supply drop
expect item Battery 2
use trawlerengine
expect message tank is dry
expect hidden enginelocker
open Fuel crate
expect story raft-Vasagatan_GasTank 1
use trawlerengine
expect message sputters, then roars
expect shown enginelocker
open Engine room locker
expect item Hinge 2
